msgid ""
"A payment cannot be processed for this referral since it is not marked as "
"Unpaid."
msgstr ""
"Pembayaran tidak dapat diproses untuk rujukan ini kerana ia tidak ditanda "
"sebagai Belum Dibayar."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-bank-accounts.php:184
